window.products.push({"id":588011,"name":"Department 56 Possible Dreams Accessories Three Elves Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WMnosKCpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you have been wanting to personalize your possible dreams Santa pieces in your home we have the answer. Add some elves to your display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WMnosKCpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B00SH6ESVG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-588011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00SH6ESVG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00SH6ESVG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":588012,"name":"Farberware PURECOOK Ceramic Nonstick Jumbo Cooker/Saute Pan with Helper Handle - 5 Quart, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717RPrr3zkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make mealtime easy and cleanup easier, from family breakfasts to one-dish dinners, with the durable and dishwasher-safe Farberware PURECOOK Ceramic Nonstick Cookware 5-Quart Jumbo Cooker with Helper Handle. Farberware PURECOOK Ceramic cookware merges sturdy aluminum construction with ceramic nonstick that provides superior food release. To help keep everyday meal-making fast and efficient, this big stockpot heats quickly and evenly, and the unique quilted cooking surface boosts the nonstick action for excellent browning. Utilize this generously-sized jumbo cooker to prepare dinner for the whole family, or cook up a double recipe of your signature recipe to enjoy one meal tonight and one meal later. The stain-resistant porcelain enamel stockpot exterior is colorful and easy to clean, and both jumbo pot handles sport distinctive stainless steel accents. The shatter-resistant glass lid fits snuggly on the pot to hold in heat and moisture while monitoring cooking. Oven safe to 350°F. Whether used as a stock pot, chili pot, pasta pot or lobster pot, big batch cooking gets a splash of color, trusted Farberware cooking performance and innovative nonstick with the durable, dishwasher-safe Farberware PURECOOK Ceramic Nonstick 5-Quart Jumbo Cooker with Helper Handle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717RPrr3zkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Farberware","source_asin":"B074LM4R83","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-588012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074LM4R83","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074LM4R83","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":588013,"name":"Ideal Home Range Printed and Embossed Caprice Cameo Cocktail Napkins, Black, 16-Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eOE1sB-wL._AC_.jpg","description":"The designers of Ideal Home Range see the beauty in paper and color and create collections to complement your life. In 1977, Ingrid and Hanjo Rick (IHR) conceived the idea of producing accessories in the arts and crafts tradition in order to communicate their concept of interior design. The first headquarters of their company was an old village school in Lower Saxony in the North of Germany. The young company grew steadily, becoming the trendsetter in its line of business. Ideal Home Range, or IHR, has gained a richly deserved worldwide reputation as the preeminent manufacturer of paper napkins, and is today considered to be the international market leader for high-class table decoration and interior accessories. The products range from tissue napkins in various sizes to decorative candles, trays, tablecloths, home textiles and interior accessories such as bone china, ceramics, porcelain, Christmas decor, ribbons, and more. Entertaining has never been so easy. IHR designs are created and printed in their own state of the art facility next to their headquarters in Northern Germany. No competitors can make this claim, and it's a big part of what makes IHR's napkins so extraordinary. Additionally, an enormous amount of resources are constantly invested every year in trend research to ensure that the IHR line is fresh and on the leading edge of home fashion at all times. There are designs for all lifestyles and taste groups. Bring IHR to your table today and you'll be happy you did.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eOE1sB-wL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ideal Home Range","source_asin":"B006J3FO9O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-588013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006J3FO9O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006J3FO9O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":588014,"name":"Waechtersbach Christmas Tree 4-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DJCKMJV8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Bring a splash of bold cheer to the holidays with this enchanting four-piece dinnerware set, which includes one place setting comprised of a 10-inch dinner plate, a 7-1/2-inch salad plate, a 20-ounce cereal bowl, and a 12-ounce mug. A large, smoothly curved handle allows guests to easily sip coffee, cocoa, cider, and other favorite hot drinks from the generously sized mug, while both the dinner plate and the salad plate recess slightly at the center to prevent spills while filling up at the buffet. In addition, the deep bowl offers a fitting way to serve a variety of anytime favorites mess-free--from cereal at breakfast to soups and salads at dinner to scoops of ice cream for dessert. Crafted in Germany of high-fired earthenware with a glossy red finish, the pieces bring the beauty of fine place settings and the resilience of more practical tableware to family dinners and other social events. The plates and mug feature artful evergreen trees decorated with white lights, candles, and stars. The bowl duplicates the iconic pattern in miniature along its top rim. Best of all, the set coordinates tastefully with matching pieces from Waechtersbach's entire line of Christmas Tree tableware and serveware (sold separately), with more pieces added to the line every year to satisfy the avid collector. A distinctive choice while entertaining, the set's dishwasher-safe construction makes it simple to use and maintain throughout the winter holidays. What's in the Box 1 place setting consisting of: 10-inch dinner plate; 7-1/2-inch salad plate; 20-ounce cereal bowl; 12-ounce mug. 4 pieces total. Amazon.com There's something refreshingly simple and compelling about the Christmas Tree pattern from German company Waechtersbach. Designed for everyday use during the holiday season, the dinnerware is glazed a glossy bright red all over, with a single green tree smack in the middle of the plates. White stars and balls drape and dance around the tree in an almost childlike way. Producing daily smiles, Christmas Tree lets you save your gold-rimmed china for fancier meals. This place setting for one includes a 10-inch dinner plate, 7-1/2-inch salad plate, 20-ounce cereal bowl, and 12-ounce mug. While the plates are identical except for size, the deep bowl features a row of small trees around the outside rim, while the mug highlights a tree with white candles. Glassware and linens are available separately to accessorize the dinnerware, and new pieces are added annually to satisfy the collector. Made of durable earthenware, Christmas Tree is dishwasher-safe, a boon during the busy holidays. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 1 place setting. The place setting consists of: dinner plate; salad plate; bowl; mug. 4 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DJCKMJV8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waechtersbach","source_asin":"B00099OS5U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-588014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00099OS5U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00099OS5U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
