window.products.push({"id":588221,"name":"LIEN Dish Soap Dispenser Pump and Sponge Holder, 2 in 1 Dish Washing Soap Dispenser Caddy for Kitchen, 10.5 Ounces (Sakura Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614VjOnwUOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【INNOVATIVE DESIGN】 - The tray of this sponge soap dispenser has an inclined hollow design to prevent secondary pollution of the sponge and facilitate quick drying. Small openings on the side make it easy to pour out sewage and clean. 【HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS】 - The soap dispenser is made of high-quality ABS material, with fresh colors, smooth edges, and a thickened anti-skid design at the bottom, which has both vision and texture. 【EASY OPERATION】 - Easily press the soap dispenser with one hand to get the desired liquid, and the caddy attached to the soap dispenser can hold sponges, rags, and scouring pads. Eliminate sink clutter with the 2-in-1 soap dispenser for the kitchen. 【UPGRADE PUMP】 - Large elastic upgrade pressure pump with long service life and even discharge, the pump is designed with anti-backflow design to prevent sewage from entering the soap dish when pressed. 【LARGE CAPACITY & NO WASTE】 - Large capacity of 10.5 ounces, no need to add soap frequently. A sink is added at the bottom, so that the liquid at the bottom can flow to the sink and be sucked out, and the soap liquid will not be wasted. 【OUR GUARANTEE】 - LIEN makes life simple. If you have any quality problems with the products you receive, please feel free to contact us and we will replace them or refund them in full.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614VjOnwUOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIEN","source_asin":"B0B17717D3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-588221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B17717D3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B17717D3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":588222,"name":"Rainbow Set Liquid Culture Mason Jar Lids Wide Mouth for Mycology Value Caps (Wide Mouth, Rainbow Pack 2, 8)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PVMUzbKcL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wide Mouth Rainbow Pack 2 include one of each of the following colors: Red Orange Yellow Green Blue Sapphire Pink White Mason jar lids for making mushroom liquid cultures. The polypropylene lid features a rubber self healing injection port, a high quality .22 micron filter and a silicone gasket to unsure a tight seal. These lids can be used in a microwave, autoclave or pressure cooker. They fit wide mouth mason jars. Mason Jars are NOT included. Check out Mycovations on YouTube (Search \"How to make Liquid Cultures for Mushroom Cultivation\" to find my video) Leave the lids a quarter turn loose while in the pressure cooker so air can escape, otherwise the injection ports will pop out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PVMUzbKcL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mycovations","source_asin":"B08LTZQHB7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-588222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LTZQHB7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LTZQHB7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
