window.products.push({"id":588256,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner Fan, Ultra Quiet&Strong Airflow Personal Small Evaporative Air Cooler with 3 Speeds LED Light, 2 Cool Mist&2-8H Timer, Desk C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B2DwxFjOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2023 Update 4-in-1 MULTINATIONAL AIR COOLER: This portable air cooler appliance combines the benefits of an air cooler, table fan, humidifier, and LED night light, Designed with innovation and functionality in mind, this air cooler is a one-stop solution for all your temperature control needs.Using a unique air circulation system, it cools down the air in your room without relying on chemicals or refrigerants. air conditioner making it a must-have for any household, office or dorm room Ultra-Quiet & Powerful Airflow: One of the standout features of this product is its ultra-quiet operation. Unlike other fans that can create a distracting level of noise, our model has been engineered to function discreetly and without interruption. You’ll be able to enjoy the cooling effects of this fan without any annoying background sounds to contend with. Our fan is designed with a high-performance motor and unique air duct design, quickly cooling down any small room. The compact handheld design is perfect for homes, kitchens, bedrooms, dorms, desks, offices, and garages, as well as RVs, cabins, outdoor tents, backboard parties, and camping 600ML Water Tank & Thoughtful Timer & Leak-Proof Design: We've also added a thoughtful timer feature that allows you to set the timer for unattended operation during sleep, which allows you or your kids enjoy reading or a deep sleeping or nap without the headaches and colds caused by prolonged cool winds. The timer feature saves energy and ensures optimal performance from your fan. It can works 6-8 hours when it filled up, so you don't have to get up to add water repeatedly. Also, the Water Shortage Protection Function will change it to natural wind while the water ran out, so no worries when you fall asleep.The water level window allows you to check and control the water level at any time. Comfortable,Healthy, Energy Saving: it's also energy-efficient, helping you save on your electricity bills. The device utilizes a low-power consumption technology to keep you cool and comfortable while being environmentally friendly. You'll feel good using this air cooler knowing that you're doing your part to help the planet. the LED lights also provide a romantic atmosphere help you improve your sleep. You can set the lights to automatically change colors, or choose a single color to match your mood or preference. Worry-Free Service: Finally, we stand behind our product with a satisfaction guarantee. If you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, please contact us for a full refund. We want you to love your new portable room cooler air conditioner fan as much as we do! Simple touch screen control panel design for easy operation with just a few clicks.The perfect portable evaporative cooler for yourself or a loved one,Such as for fathers day gifts .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B2DwxFjOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FERRISA","source_asin":"B0C3T433VM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-588256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3T433VM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3T433VM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":588257,"name":"LLADRÓ Camel Nativity Figurine. Porcelain Nativity Camel Figure.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":422.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713QDb+t-QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HANDMADE IN SPAIN: The highest-quality pieces handcrafted in Valencia, in the only LLADRÓ factory in the world. A team of expert artists and designers keep alive ancestral trades and techniques to turn porcelain into dreams. Sculptors, ornamenters, technicians, painters are all involved in the craftsmanship process... An endless number of hands that, one by one, leave their mark, an almost imperceptible imprint, making each artwork UNIQUE and EXCLUSIVE. BEAUTY AND SUSTAINABILITY: Our goal is always to create beauty from a place of sustainability and respect, principles that are part of the brand’s DNA. Lladró respects all the resources involved in the process of creating, making and selling our porcelain artworks, to offer a BEAUTIFUL, SUSTAINABLE and DURABLE product. QUALITY AND EXCELLENCE: The pursuit of perfection is not only part of the process of designing and creating the pieces, but also extends to quality control, where the finished SCULPTURE undergoes various tests to certify that it meets Lladró’s high self-imposed standards. Excellence is also applied to the packaging, which is customised to the particularities of each piece, so that it reaches its final destination safely and in PERFECT condition. A GIFT THAT WILL LAST A LIFETIME: The finest details come in the form of porcelain. Gifting a LLADRÓ artwork is synonymous with celebration and joy. It’s a way of saying: I love you, I am happy for your success or welcome. We have the perfect piece for every SPECIAL OCCASION, thanks to a wide range of artistic creations that your loved ones will value and treasure forever. LLADRÓ: Founded in 1953, Lladró is the result of three brothers’ passion for PORCELAIN; Juan, José and Vicente Lladró. Over the years, the expressive possibilities of porcelain have been pushed to the limit, reaching its own unique and distinctive style, which has given the company international fame.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713QDb+t-QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lladro","source_asin":"B0006VM218","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-588257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006VM218","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006VM218","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
