window.products.push({"id":588515,"name":"Master Grade Premium Knife Sharpener Bundle Deal with Japanese Usuba Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uhulxk5OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You don’t have time to wait around for a better knife sharpener, and neither do we. That’s why we created it. Master Grade is designed with professionals in mind, but is just as easy to use at home for professional results. Master Grade is always about quality, performance and value. Master Grade bakes its grinding stones for 45 days-to create a superior product that outperforms other stones that are only baked for 1-3 days. Master Grade has exclusive patented angle guides that are able to sharpen and resurface the thinnest knife blades of 1/4 wide and 1/8 high. No other knife sharpener can function compete because other machines only sharpen blades up to 1/16 high. Master Grade’s unique angle guides solve the problem. It works for recurved blade (aka hawksbill or tourne blade, by moving the machine following the knife angle, the only one that can do it in the market) Will sharpen your knife sharp, so you don't have to throw away your dull knives Re-profile blade to restores bevel/extends cutlery life up to 10 times Premium Soft stone technology minimizes burr Bundle deal includes Japanese Usuba knife","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uhulxk5OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Master Grade","source_asin":"B07VNBRFSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-588515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VNBRFSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VNBRFSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
