window.products.push({"id":588567,"name":"Aivanart Christmas Gnomes Plush Santa Doll, Christmas Gonk Dwarf Elf Figurines Xmas Ornaments Tabletop Decoration for Valentines Day Holiday Supplies ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ouv4nRa2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Christmas Day Decor：There are 3 lovely stuffed gnomes for romantic Christmas Day decor in one pack, two 11 inches and one 7.9 inches tall. Their colors and sizes are a bit different, but they are equally cute. Every gnome doll has a little red heart on its hat. Decorating the room with these cute little gnomes will definitely bring a lot of holiday joy to your family. Premium Quality Handicrafts：Our valentine plush gnomes are hand-made with premium materials. These valentine home decorations are made of soft felt fabric and coral fleece,no any odour. There is a small amount of sand in the bottom of the gnome doll to help the elf valentines day decoration stand on the table firmly. Both arms and caps are equipped with wire，you can adjust the posture according to your preferences. Spread the Sweet Affection: In folklore, gnomes are responsible for protecting the farm or people from evil and misfortune. They are regarded as a symbol of good luck. Now they have become an indispensable decoration for Valentine’s Day. Add these cute valentine tomte gnomes to your home decor, and share the joy and affection with your lovers at the Valentines gathering dinner party! Great Valentines Day Decorations for the Home：These lovely holiday gnomes are perfect as valentines home decorations. You can put them on desks, closets, bookshelves, coffee tables, dining tables, fireplaces, etc. Swedish gnomes can also be used as decorations for Valentine's Day, themed parties, and farmhouse. They convey warmth and love in the cold winter, accompany and guard everyone in the family. Valentines Day Gifts：Gnomes represent good luck and protection, and giving them to wife and girlfriend will be a good way for us to express our love. Sending these cute gnome at the valentines day will be very romantic and sweet. In addition, the cute appearance of these tomtes makes them very popular with girls, I believe they will be very happy to receive this gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ouv4nRa2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aivanart","source_asin":"B09F32LYD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-588567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F32LYD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F32LYD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":588568,"name":"Prepac Double Wall Mounted Storage Cabinet, Cherry and Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":95.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41484qpQxJL._AC_.jpg","description":"A beautiful mix of practical storage and Home Décor fashion, the Double Floating Wall Storage is ideal for managing a medium collection of CDs or DVDs with style. Mount on your wall as a stand-alone décor piece or above a complementary piece to make your collection easily accessible. Floating wall storage is ideal when floor space is limited and with our easy to hang system can be mounted at any height to best suit your room requirements.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41484qpQxJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prepac","source_asin":"B0BN7FQ8FT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-588568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN7FQ8FT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN7FQ8FT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":588569,"name":"Belleek Colleen 10-Inch Vase","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DZJ01AABL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Belleek Colleen 10\" Vase features a basket weave design complimented with shamrocks. Amazon.com Sculpted all over with Belleek's signature basket-weave design, this textured vase looks like a real country basket, right down to the scalloped top edge. The vase is glazed milky white inside and out in order to hold bouquets of real flowers, and displays delicate green shamrocks hand-painted on the outside for an Irish touch. Tapering in toward the middle and flaring out at the top, the vase stands ten inches tall and should be washed by hand for best results. The Colleen vase is made in Ireland of parian, a fine porcelain china invented in Great Britain in the 1840s for sculpting classical figurines. Because of the china's marble-like translucence, the name derived from the Greek island of Paros, famous for its prized white marble. Belleek parian ware exhibits exceptional craftsmanship and is esteemed among collectors worldwide. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DZJ01AABL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Belleek","source_asin":"B000630OWK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-588569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000630OWK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000630OWK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
