window.products.push({"id":588738,"name":"Inflatable Neck Pillow for Traveling, Travel Pillows for Sleeping Airplane, Travel Essentials for Car, Flying, Long Flight, Head and Chin Support Dark","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PRuRUQ3zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Note】The Air Pump faces down when in use. 【Perfect Head Support Travel Neck Pillow】The sides of our pillow are wide and thick enough, can better wrap your neck and free your chin, prevents the head from falling forward, relieves neck pain during travel. 【Press-To-Inflate & Support Adjustable】Our neck pillow uses press-to-inflation technology, You can create the best neck support and comfort by adding or decreasing air. Compared with sponge pillows, pressing can adjust the softness and facilitate portability. Compared with mouth inflation, pressing can inflate more air to obtain higher support. 【100% Velvety Cover】The travel neck pillow uses soft velvet fabric that is non-irritating and odor, It has a comfortable non-sweat cover that can keep your face refreshing. 【Portable & Space Saving】Weighs only 6 oz. About the size of a pop can after venting. It comes with a storage bag that allows the travel pillow to compress down to a smaller size.You could use it not only for hours plane ride sleep, but also road trip, office and home. 【Practical For Any Occasions】This travel pillow could use it not only for airplane flight, but also train, car, office and home; Prepare this neck pillow for your parents, friends and relatives, this would be a healthy gift with love!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PRuRUQ3zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Centuckos","source_asin":"B0BHQM8YDK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-588738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHQM8YDK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHQM8YDK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":588739,"name":"TeeFity Vegetable Chopper, Multifunctional Chopper Vegetable Cutter with 7 Interchangeable Blades, Mandoline Onion Dicer for Kitchen, Veggie Chopper F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RxW8eQ1NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MULTI FUNCTIONAL VEGETABLE CHOPPER】: This veggie chopper has 7 interchangeable and easily detachable blades. In addition, it is also equipped with a garlic grinder, egg separator, Peeler, large capacity container, drainage basket, protective cover, and cleaning claw. It allows you to easily slice, shred, dice, grind vegetables and fruits. It is a perfect home cooking tool! 【HIGH-QUALITY AND DURABLE】: This vegetable slicer Dicer cutter is made of stainless steel blades and food grade ABS plastic, BPA free, drop resistant and sturdy, the onion chopper blade is sharp enough to cut most kinds of vegetables and fruits. anti-skid handle, fine workmanship, and the bottom of the chopper also has a non-slip design, which is stable and more labor-saving. 【EASY TO ClEAN AND NO MESS】: After using the food chopper, just use cleaning claw to scrape off the residue on the pressing plate and clean the blade and the chopper body. After cleaning, air dry the blade and collect it into the chopper container, which will make your countertop without messy. Please note that the vegetable cutter is not resistant to high temperature, so avoid cleaning it in the dishwasher. Be careful when installing, disassembling and cleaning the blade to avoid hand injury. Finally, keep them away from children. 【DEFINITELY SAVES TIME】: Want to escape the trap of fast-food, but worry that preparing meals takes too much time and energy? Don't worry, our multi-functional vegetable chopper and slicer will help you solve this problem. It can handle most vegetables and fruits, making it easier for you to add a variety of nutrients to your family meals. It is a perfect gift for friends, family and other cooking enthusiasts. 【EXCEPTIONAL CUSTOMER SERVICE】: Please read the instructions included in the package carefully before use. if you find that the vegetable cutter is damaged, missing accessories or encounter other problems during use, please send a message to us at any time, we will reply within 24 hours and provide a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RxW8eQ1NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TeeFity","source_asin":"B0BRKM1P9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-588739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRKM1P9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRKM1P9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
