window.products.push({"id":588854,"name":"Westbrooke 100% Cotton Percale Sheet Set - 4 Piece Queen Size Sheets - 1 Flat Sheet, 1 Fitted Sheet with 15.5\" Deep Pocket & 2 Pillowcases - Soft & Br","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VnKu-MQFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"100% PURE COTTON SHEETS WITH PERCALE WEAVE FOR EXTREME COMFORT: Made with 100% long-staple cotton yarns, Wetsbrooke 200 thread count sheets are super-soft and silky for extreme comfort and a cozy sleeping environment. The cooling and breathability of these sheets is unique in the market and comes at a highly reasonable & affordable price.The high quality percale weave provides a premium lustrous finish and elegant look to these luxury hotel sheets. 4 PIECE EXTRA DEEP POCKET QUEEN SHEET SET: Bring home a touch of hotel luxury bedding that is thicker than your average sheet. The 4 piece Teal Green Queen size sheet set includes 1 flat sheet (90” x 104”), 1 fitted sheet (60”x 80”), and 2 pillowcases (20” x 32\"). The bottom sheet has a 15.5 inch elasticized deep pocket with an all-around elastic for a snug-fit & delightful sleeping experience. ULTRA-SOFT & SMOOTH WITH EASE OF CARE: Each sheet is expertly woven to ensure pill-resistance and long-lasting strength. Highest-quality dyes are used in manufacturing the sheets for fade-resistance, while long-staple cotton yarns ensure no loose fibres. Wash at room temperature and tumble dry on low to avoid shrinkage & avoid wrinkles. Fold them neatly until next use. PERFECT FOR GIFITNG: Our high quality bedding sets are elegantly crafted for a comfortable sleep & lusturous shine. The variety of colours not only compliment your room decor, but also add a luxurious touch to your day-to-day life. All of it makes them one of the best decor and gifting choices for your family, coworkers and loved ones on all the occasions. CERTIFIED & TRUSTWORTHY WITH SUSTAINABLE PRACTICES: Manufactured using 100% Green energy generated from windmills, this bedding set is made from OEKO-TEX 100 certified dyes and is free from any harmful chemicals. The manufacturing processes are sustainable and vertically integrated, right from spinning the yarn to the finished product, making them safe not only for adults and children but also for your pet & the planet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VnKu-MQFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Westbrooke","source_asin":"B0C6FM5LJZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-588854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6FM5LJZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6FM5LJZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
